{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act25side_level_act25side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act25side",
  "stageId": "act25side_07",
  "title": "空中樓閣",
  "storyCode": "CW-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "82b671b230a9a1bee9a011ab4c556d564fed674cd5c10902f8fab0242d386bfa",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g7_mainstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我們必須馬上離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我找到了克麗斯騰的能量源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趁一切還沒有不可挽回，趁我預想中的那種最壞的可能還沒有發生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們仍然有機會阻止她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這裡怎麼會有石棺？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克麗斯騰的計劃需要大量的能量，這種能量的規模和純度都是現代泰拉人無法掌握，乃至無法想像的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以，她使用了這座石棺的技術？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這能量之龐大，一座石棺也無法支撐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那，她是怎麼......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說的是，“一座”石棺也無法支撐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒想到......居然在哥倫比亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然就在這片荒野之下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，我需要你的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能幫助我的......也只能是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "迷迭香呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我很擔心迷迭香的狀況。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰鬥已經結束，她不會有危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請相信迷迭香，她還是個孩子，但她也是羅德島的精英幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也請你相信......你與她共度的歲月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論是我們在切爾諾伯格的行動，還是她在羅德島的日子，這些過去都沒有被虛擲，這些經歷同樣在塑造著她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她會做出自己的選擇，我們也只能尊重這種選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是......現在，同樣也輪到我們了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:45 P.M. 聚焦發生器抵達能量井上方"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g2_colombiaoffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "精彩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直很好奇，你是怎麼在面對那一堆研究項目的同時，還練出這麼好的身手的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為我已經把時間利用得夠好了，你不睡覺的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼會在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斐爾迪南。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這問題該我問，塞雷婭，你闖進軍方在特里蒙的特種作戰辦公室，想幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜，你想找一個能追上天上那玩意的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如，劫持一架軍方的重型無人機，然後把自己綁在上面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是想得太簡單了些，塞雷婭主任？我原本以為你沒有這麼感情用事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓開，斐爾迪南。現在我沒時間和你囉嗦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞧瞧，多可憐，唯三......好吧，科考科的那傢伙不算，唯二被總轄排除在她的那些了不起的大計劃之外的主任，居然在這裡相會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想做什麼，阻止那個瘋子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是......挽救她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不需要向你匯報什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，我也無意評價你與克麗斯騰之間的關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在這裡就是為了等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽好了，塞雷婭，我不是來找你麻煩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，讓開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，“聽好了”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......飛行器的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斐爾迪南，這架飛行器是哪裡來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“地平弧光計劃”不僅是現在克麗斯騰開著的飄在天頂的超級武器，它是一整套戰略方案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我動用了點關係，借用了一架用於“弧光一號”檢修的飛行器，順便把剩下的都炸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要知道，整個哥倫比亞，能在接近阻隔層高度安全行駛的載人飛行器可不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們從特區重新調配高空飛行器需要的時間不會很多，但對於你，對於我，都已經足夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在向我提出合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以為，你真的有這個資格？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還是老樣子，塞雷婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一副就算沒有我幫忙，你也有本事解決一切麻煩的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，我對此倒是沒有絲毫懷疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭，就像我之前說的，我們之間沒有必要起衝突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聚焦發生器已經飛抵能量井上空，能量井已經開始聚能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果放任現在的局勢發展，無論克麗斯騰想幹什麼，這件事的結局最終如何，國防部勢必遭到清算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而萊茵生命，作為“幫兇”，我們都能猜到它的下場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而無論是作為軍方的白手套，還是萊茵生命的前主任，斐爾迪南，你也完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我不打算放任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我們還來得及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們可以在能量激發之前，讓聚焦發生器重新平穩降落，一切就還有挽回的餘地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想挽回的，是你的性命，還是萊茵生命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這重要嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你該坦誠點，斐爾迪南。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你早就準備好了這架飛行器，你早就料到克麗斯騰能做到這一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我原以為防衛科的那些事務工作已經磨去了你作為研究者的洞察力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，沒有你想的那麼早。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的以為你的這次冒險能挽救什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果你不這麼認為，為什麼要來這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g2_colombiaoffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭，你知道我最近這段時間一個最深的感受是什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像沒有人在乎萊茵生命這塊招牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他人要嘛為了萊茵生命能帶給他們的研究資源，要嘛只關心克麗斯騰在做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你或許想過克麗斯騰的下場，但你想過萊茵會變得怎麼樣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，我明白，你們都是被她的個人魅力吸引來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "捫心自問，我難道不是嗎？我也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，萊茵生命是我們共同的心血。我不能接受我參與其中的心血被她付之一炬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論出於怎樣的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我寧願當軍方的牙獸，也想把萊茵從懸崖邊拉回來，我難道錯了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒想到，你會對我說這樣的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像是個防衛科主任該說的台詞，嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說真的，我真該把屬於你的那份工資一起領了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經不再是防衛科主任了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，等到事情結束，我會和雅拉談談我的漲薪問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你得先重新入職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，有件事情你說對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "挽救萊茵......並不是我唯一的目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我需要萊茵，萊茵也需要我，這是我基於理性和感性的判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坦誠地說，我很好奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那可是克麗斯騰，我們認識的那個克麗斯騰，軍方以為她想炸了哪裡，怎麼可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們和她共事了那麼久，我們都知道她是怎樣的人，當然，你比我們都更瞭解她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞雷婭，老實和我說，她到底想做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她會做到什麼程度？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有猜測。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "猜測，很謹慎的用詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，你到底來不來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些現在正在發動攻擊的無人機，雖然暫時打不穿聚焦發生器的裝甲，也無法抵達它的懸停高度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是擊落你的這架檢修飛行器沒什麼難的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猜，軍方和梅蘭德也一定正在部署火力更強、升空高度更高的特種無人機，乃至運載士兵的登陸艇。它們投入前線只是時間問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們需要開著你這架幾乎沒有裝甲、並未搭載任何武器的小飛行器，穿過無人機的火力網。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這確實有點冒險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我來駕駛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隨你的便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斐爾迪南",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_890_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，你真的會開這東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我在大學的時候，學過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:50 P.M. 聚焦發生器抵達3000米高空"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g14_energywell"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從剛才開始，傳導物質的反應，好像更強烈了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應該......就是這附近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還是不行！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能量讀數表已經不顯示數據了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停下了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是！這東西已經超過了示數最大值了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "技術手冊裡可沒說過這種情況！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別管*哥倫比亞俚語*的技術手冊了，給我想點辦法出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整個設施的供能管線應該都已經切斷了才對......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些能量......到底是從哪裡來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想告訴我，這些沾一點邊就能讓我們化成灰的能量，是憑空冒出來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，你這個推測還需要論證......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閉嘴吧，繼續給我想辦法，否則我就把你先扔進去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再檢查一遍，管線......開關......能量節點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這玩意......這玩意會不會爆炸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "技術手冊上......呃，我覺得，大概，現在聚集的能量已經超過結構理論安全值了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是炸了，會怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......喂，你幫我分析分析。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是真的出了什麼意外......會不會波及約肯特？離這不遠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "約、約肯特？我不清楚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就告訴我，會炸多大的範圍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我早就和姐夫說過，來特里蒙附近拓荒不是個好主意，這裡住的全是瘋子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我在算！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*哥倫比亞俚語*，你們這幫科學瘋子！科學瘋子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們腦子裡就沒有半根保險絲嗎？你們天天把那些好像多麼了不起的項目掛在嘴邊，就不考慮考慮搞砸了的後果？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們號稱的特里蒙的科學精神，就是建了這麼個會自己啟動，還死活關不掉的大炸彈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是我負責的項目！我是被你們的上校臨時派來幫忙的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，如果是我的話，肯定會多實驗幾次......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別放屁了，我太瞭解你們了，一點點成功的跡象就能晃得你們這種人找不著北！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......這不是國防部的人主導的項目嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那他們都是瘋子！我奶奶說要來哥倫比亞發展的時候，我就警告過他們，哥倫比亞是個瘋子組成的國家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死的，算出來沒！不行，我得打個電話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼通訊撥不出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "研究員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是能量密度太高了，影響了訊號的傳輸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死，真該死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡的訊號好點？換條走廊有用嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
