    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡已經完全陷入混亂了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能量的傳輸......無法停止？克麗斯騰到底想幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傳導物質的反應，還在變強......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師調整過的這些傳導物質，應該都在聚焦發生器上才對，為什麼這裡也會有這麼劇烈的反應......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫默",
      "speakerId": "avg_1031_slent2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......我必須......"
